# Deny by default; explicitly include public build inputs.
*
!pyproject.toml
!Dockerfile
!README.md
!LICENSE
!CHANGELOG.md
!SECURITY.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!.env.example
!src/
!src/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**

# Never include generated or private material even if a later rule changes.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/secrets/**
**/runtime/**
**/production/**
**/staging/**
**/migration/**
**/cutover/**
**/backups/**
**/logs/**
**/screenshots/**
